## 🛡️ Defensive Takeaway
Understanding automated payload generators highlights why modern security operations cannot rely solely on **static file hashes**. Effective defense requires **Behavioral EDR monitoring**, **AppLocker/WDAC execution policies**, and strict **egress network filtering**.
